        "TileImage": "$($repository 3e3e3752-37db-4b0f-8ff3-827d4c565e55).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rThere is a feeling in the ICA that the traditional methods of assassination are becoming too outdated. Sniping three targets at the top of the world&apos;s tallest building should be enough to prove otherwise.\r\rOur clients want drama, they want headlines across the world, and this is how we&apos;ll deliver.\r\rSebastian Sato: A fashionista who insulted the wrong ensemble.\rHenry Nigel: The mastermind behind the Rose Armstrong kidnapping.\rPrudence Ramsey: A blackmailer who didn&apos;t know when to stop.",
